message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "agentic-graph-orchestration"
abstract: >-
  A skill and a working product graph for building closed-loop multi-agent systems:
  success criteria and a verifier are written before any work is spawned, the job is
  modelled as a graph of nodes, edges and anchors, loops are closed on evidence,
  irreversible gates (accept, post, pay, publish, safety) stay out of the model's hands,
  and a linter rejects any graph that is not ready to implement.
